---
import Arrow from "../Arrow.astro";
import "../global.css";
import MyMap from "../MyMap";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" />
    <meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
    <title>Η επέτειος μας🩷</title>
  </head>
  <body class="font-arima bg-background text-foreground">
    <main
      class="mx-auto flex min-h-screen max-w-5xl flex-col justify-center gap-10 relative"
    >
      <section class="flex items-center gap-8 text-center sm:text-left">
        <div class="bg-accent h-80 w-80 shrink-0 rounded-full shadow-lg"></div>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
          <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold leading-tight sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">
            Χαρούμενος ένας χρόνος Κατερίνα!🩷
          </h1>
          <p class="max-w-xl text-base text-foreground/80 sm:text-lg">
            Μια μικρή στιγμή για να γιορτάσουμε όσα μοιραστήκαμε μαζί.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <p class="absolute bottom-4 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2">
        (κάνε scroll)
        <Arrow />
      </p>
    </main>

    <section
      class="mx-auto max-w-3xl pb-24 pt-24 text-base leading-8 text-foreground/80 sm:text-lg"
    >
      <p>
        Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Commodi tenetur
        eum similique veniam odit. Expedita mollitia, quaerat excepturi quam ex
        magnam eaque earum error, reprehenderit quo consequatur vero? Quidem
        voluptatibus molestias possimus eos dolorem dolor nobis voluptatum
        molestiae unde magnam voluptate facilis a obcaecati, nesciunt delectus
        autem, enim quis vero?
      </p>
    </section>
    <section class="min-h-screen bg-accent">
      <MyMap client:only />
    </section>
  </body>
</html>
